   "text": "꿈짖!",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 2
  },
  {
   "id": 1269,
   "offset": 3946381,
   "text": "꿈□!",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 1270,
   "offset": 3946388,
   "text": "꿈□!",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 1272,
   "offset": 3946396,
   "text": "낫제데쿠브제데쿠뮤제데쿠덴제데쿠콧제데쿠{var:23}는\n{var:16}사용했다!",
