  },
  {
   "id": 1288,
   "offset": 3946630,
   "text": "노니!",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 2
  },
  {
   "id": 1289,
   "offset": 3946634,
   "text": "끼!\n낡멈군□!",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 4
  },
  {
   "id": 1290,
   "offset": 3946648,
   "text": "토코로베란타노니!",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 8
  },
  {
   "id": 1291,
   "offset": 3946658,
   "text": "요케라레타!\n코이츠하츠카마리소우니나이부!",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 19
  },
  {
   "id": 1292,
   "offset": 3946682,
   "text": "해냈다!\n{var:06}를잡았다!보아\n\n",
