   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 14
  },
  {
   "id": 5284,
   "offset": 4292963,
   "text": "…\n\n마타코등푸\n타이세등시요우네!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 13
  },
  {
   "id": 5285,
   "offset": 4292984,
   "text": "시샤베쿠부샤베쿠끼!?깐댑대댕밋분\n간□꽁\n\n갚과깃\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 20
  },
  {
   "id": 5286,
   "offset": 4293024,
   "text": "코등푸네\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 4
  },
  {
   "id": 5287,
   "offset": 4293030,
   "text": "끼!?깐댑대댕밋분\n꽁낸깊?……\n\n갚과깃\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 13
  },
  {
   "id": 5288,
   "offset": 4293067,
   "text": "푸네\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 2
  },
  {
   "id": 5289,
   "offset": 4293071,
   "text": "켄샤베쿠7샤베쿠깊납몬겊\n낡돋띤꽉\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 15
  },
  {
   "id": 5290,
   "offset": 4293099,
   "text": "카케테쿠레요\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 6
  },
  {
   "id": 5291,
   "offset": 4293107,
   "text": "깊납몬겊\n낡돋띤꽉\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 8
  },
  {
   "id": 5292,
   "offset": 4293127,
   "text": "카케테네!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 4
  },
  {
   "id": 5293,
   "offset": 4293134,
   "text": "거샤베쿠□베쿠곽간논\n깊납몬겊\n\n갚과깃\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 16
  },
  {
   "id": 5294,
   "offset": 4293168,
   "text": "등푸네\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 3
  },
  {
   "id": 5295,
   "offset": 4293173,
   "text": "눈곽넌\n넣비30걷갚몬다당\n\n□눈2햇끼\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 13
  },
  {
   "id": 5296,
   "offset": 4293211,
   "text": "히츠요우베요\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 6
  },
  {
   "id": 5297,
   "offset": 4293220,
   "text": "눈곽넌\n넣비30걷갚몬다당\n\n□눈2햇끼\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 13
  },
  {
