   "offset": 4293528,
   "text": "테라레테루네!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 6
  },
  {
   "id": 5317,
   "offset": 4293537,
   "text": "관몬!\n깠픕뒈갔!!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 6
  },
  {
   "id": 5318,
   "offset": 4293558,
   "text": "더덕\n깊깐급뜻넌몬덥쁜!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 10
  },
  {
   "id": 5319,
   "offset": 4293584,
   "text": "다당경곁몬캬럴\n꿈계눈!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 10
  },
  {
   "id": 5321,
   "offset": 4293611,
   "text": "미어베쿠자어베쿠란어베쿠완어베쿠훈어베쿠3어베쿠·어베쿠V어베쿠관끗!\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 31
  },
  {
   "id": 5322,
   "offset": 4293651,
   "text": "-후무후무\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 4
  },
  {
   "id": 5323,
   "offset": 4293659,
   "text": "곽강몬\n꽉꼬간깨겹!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 8
  },
  {
   "id": 5324,
   "offset": 4293680,
   "text": "와세루나요!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 5
  },
  {
   "id": 5325,
   "offset": 4293688,
   "text": "끼\n깊깐납끗\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 5
  },
  {
   "id": 5326,
   "offset": 4293701,
   "text": "등베\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 2
  },
  {
   "id": 5327,
   "offset": 4293705,
   "text": "……낚헉?\n곽강낚헉?\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 6
  },
  {
   "id": 5328,
   "offset": 4293727,
   "text": "코우이우코토카?\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 7
  },
  {
   "id": 5329,
   "offset": 4293737,
   "text": "……끼?\n간깨겹끼!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 5
  },
  {
   "id": 5330,
   "offset": 4293757,
   "text": "와!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 5331,
   "offset": 4293761,
   "text": "깐관낚헉!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 4
  },
  {
   "id": 5332,
   "offset": 4293776,
   "text": "건걷!\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 2
  },
  {
   "id": 5333,
   "offset": 4293783,
   "text": "!\n소노코토요!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 5
  },
  {
   "id": 5334,
   "offset": 4293793,
   "text": "……\n괘깊끗!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 3
  },
  {
   "id": 5335,
   "offset": 4293808,
   "text": "레소레!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 3
  },
  {
   "id": 5336,
   "offset": 4293814,
   "text": "시톰베쿠후톰베쿠조톰베쿠돈톰베쿠완톰베쿠톰톰베쿠팜톰베쿠3톰베쿠벤□렁렇미\n겉댑대댕밋분깃\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 42
  },
  {
   "id": 5337,
   "offset": 4293875,
   "text": "베\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 5338,
   "offset": 4293878,
   "text": "겨꾸덱□\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 3
  },
  {
   "id": 5340,
   "offset": 4293893,
   "text": "벤□렁렇미\n겉댑대댕밋분깃\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 11
  },
  {
   "id": 5341,
   "offset": 4293923,
   "text": "란테루노\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 4
  },
  {
   "id": 5342,
   "offset": 4293929,
   "text": "겨꾸덱□!\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 3
  },
  {
   "id": 5344,
   "offset": 4293946,
   "text": "거톰베쿠베쿠쿠류베쿠와류베쿠끼!\n꽉나눈깠콘다당!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 22
  },
  {
   "id": 5345,
   "offset": 4293986,
   "text": "나눈몬다당\n둑둔경곁넘공끓",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 12
  },
  {
   "id": 5346,
   "offset": 4294014,
   "text": "타요\n\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 2
  },
  {
   "id": 5347,
   "offset": 4294019,
   "text": "곧교경곁다당깃!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 7
  },
  {
   "id": 5348,
   "offset": 4294037,
   "text": "테루노!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 3
  },
  {
   "id": 5349,
   "offset": 4294043,
   "text": "나눈몬다당\n둑둔경곁넘공끓!\n\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 12
  },
  {
   "id": 5350,
   "offset": 4294073,
   "text": "돈류베쿠안류베쿠톰류베쿠탕류베쿠{var:02}\n겉끓경곁□돌꺼!\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 22
  },
  {
   "id": 5351,
   "offset": 4294128,
   "text": "꽂꽃\n경곁□돌꺼\n\n끔엉뷔멜먼몬다당\n엉뷔끗?",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 17
  },
  {
   "id": 5352,
   "offset": 4294169,
   "text": "쿠\n스루코토제피키마스\n\n토우로쿠시마스카?",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 18
  },
  {
   "id": 5353,
   "offset": 4294193,
   "text": "경곁□돌꺼같\n다당엉뷔미\n\n겉공□돌꺼몬댑대댕\n낡넓늘낙문몬다당\n\n궂엉뷔몬다당\n함갔경곁\n\n군것눈엉뷔다당\n궂꿈꾸댑대댕\n\n함갔경곁\n\n엉뷔끗?",
   "unknown": 2,
   "hangul": 56
  },
  {
   "id": 5354,
   "offset": 4294347,
   "text": "경곁□돌꺼엉뷔\n런껼끓\n\n률률걸검!\n\n",
   "unknown": 1,
   "hangul": 13
  },
  {
   "id": 5355,
   "offset": 4294397,
   "text": "□돌꺼같\n던깊갯□궂다당엉뷔\n\n\n",
   "unknown": 2,
   "hangul": 11
  },
  {
   "id": 5356,
   "offset": 4294431,
   "text": "갱횟나눈몬다당놉놋\n",
   "unknown": 0,
   "hangul": 9
